              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.21.5+LUK.21.6+LUK.21.7+LUK.21.8+LUK.21.9+LUK.21.10+LUK.21.11+LUK.21.12+LUK.21.13+LUK.21.14+LUK.21.15+LUK.21.16+LUK.21.17+LUK.21.18+LUK.21.19+LUK.21.20+LUK.21.21+LUK.21.22+LUK.21.23+LUK.21.24+LUK.21.25+LUK.21.26+LUK.21.27+LUK.21.28+LUK.21.29+LUK.21.30+LUK.21.31+LUK.21.32+LUK.21.33+LUK.21.34+LUK.21.35+LUK.21.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 21:5-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw arasohoka mu rusengero, umwe mu bigishwa biwe aramubgira, ati Mwigisha, rāba aya mabuye ukw ari, n’iyi nyubako ukw iri! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aramubaza, at’ Urarāba iyi nyubako ihambaye? Ntihazosigazwa ibuye rigeretse ku rindi, ridasamburiwe hasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yicaye ku musozi wa Elayono yerekeye ku rusengero, Petero na Yakobo na Yohana na Andereya baramubaza bihereranye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bati Tubgire, ivyo bizobaho ryari, ikimenyetso kizoba iki, c’igihe ivyo vyose bizoba bigira bishike? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu atangura kubabgira, ati Mwirinde ntihagire ūbazimiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benshi bazoza mw izina ryanje, bati Ndi we; kandi bazozimiza benshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ni mwumva intambara n’impuha z’intambara, ntimuze muhagarike imitima: ntibizobura kubaho, arik’ umuhero uzoba utaraza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.19.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 19:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.15.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 15:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ihanga rizotera irindi hanga, n’ubgami buzotera ubundi bgami, isi izonyiganyiga henshi, amapfa azotera. Ivyo n’itanguriro ryo kuramukwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
